# scripts/ is NOT ignored: the Dockerfile copies it, because this deployment
# pulls an image instead of checking out the repo, so diagnostics and one-off
# analyses have to be runnable with `docker compose exec`. Excluding it here
# makes the COPY fail the build outright ("/scripts": not found).

